    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43160</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>エトス</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ethos</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Speakers>
  <Strings>
    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42412</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_018_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>君たちは……エルフでは
ないようだが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well...you don't
seem like elves...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42488</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_018_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>はい、違いますけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, you're right,
we're not, but...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42620</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_018_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>魔術を使えるのはエルフだけのはずだ。
でも、君たちは魔術を使える。どうしてだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Only elves should be able to use magic.
But you can use it, too. Why is that?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42684</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_018_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>えっと……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Umm...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42780</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_018_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そこが『なりきり士』の
すごいところだぜ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's one of the incredible
things about "Roleplayers"!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>42912</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_018_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>エルフでもないのに魔術を、か。
『なりきり士』っていうのは得体の知れない力だな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That they can use magic even if they're not
elves? "Roleplayer" is a pretty strange power.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43056</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_018_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あっ、もしかして料理人の服着れば、超一流の
すげーうまい豪華料理を作って食えるんじゃねーの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, hey, if we dressed up as chefs, couldn't
we cook and eat a real five-star meal?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43164</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_018_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>大工さんになったら、
エトスハウスを新しく建て直せるかも</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And if you became carpenters, you
could probably renovate my house.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43256</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_018_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>家の修理も、豪華料理も
材料が必要だよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We'd need the right materials to fix the
house or cook a gourmet meal, though.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43328</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_018_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>君はリアリストだな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You're a realist.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>43408</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VCT_001_018_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>っていうか、
夢がないぜ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You can say that, but it's more
like she's not got any dreams...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
  </Strings>
